# Reenact the Crime: "nonland card". Bot1 casts Entomb, which puts a Swamp into the graveyard this turn. The Swamp is refused as a
# target, while Entomb itself (also put there this turn) is legal: Reenact the Crime exiles Entomb, Bot1 casts its copy for free and
# searches for a second Swamp, so both Swamps are in the graveyard and the Entomb card is exiled. A player is no card either: Bot2 is
# refused too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Entomb
Reenact the Crime
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

